Derivation and modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is a partial extraction of DoubleZero's geolocation verification
system, described in that project's RFC-16. It is an independent derivative: it
does not connect to, depend on, or interoperate with the DoubleZero network, and
it is not endorsed by or affiliated with Malbec Labs.

Files reproduced verbatim from DoubleZero:

  internal/signed/*.go
      Copied from tools/twamp/pkg/signed/ without functional modification.
      Only the module import path in the *_test.go files was changed.

Files derived from DoubleZero with substantial modification:

  internal/offset/offset.go
      Reimplemented from controlplane/telemetry/internal/geoprobe/offset.go and
      signer.go. The wire layout is preserved for compatibility with
      internal/signed; the Borsh and Solana dependencies were removed in favour
      of encoding/binary and crypto/ed25519, and the field carrying a Solana
      slot number now carries a Unix timestamp.

Files written for this repository, not derived from DoubleZero:

  cmd/anchor/, cmd/attester/, internal/keys/, internal/geo/, docs/

Components of DoubleZero's system deliberately omitted here: the Solana ledger
and all onchain account discovery, the third measurement tier in which network
devices act as roots of trust, the outbound probing flow, the ICMP pinger, and
the ClickHouse, Prometheus and DNS subsystems.

The constants in internal/geo/distance.go match those in the
sovereignty-certificate reference implementation so distances produced by the
two systems are directly comparable.
